<template><div><section><h2 id="details-setup">Key Features: ventilation and Rushmore</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-setup-1" data-guide-step>Turn on power and complete the bunker ventilation lockdown. Clear the blocked vents to enable Pack-a-Punch.</li>
<li id="guide-step-setup-2" data-guide-step>Activate Rushmore and obtain the required melee equipment for the TV clue route. Build the shield and prepare your weapon upgrades.</li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-clocks">TV clues and clock settings</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-clocks-1" data-guide-step>Activate the static televisions using Galvaknuckles and record each letter/time clue as A–F plus HHMM.</li>
<li id="guide-step-clocks-2" data-guide-step>Set the five indicated clocks: A Yellow House, B Green House, C Prisoner Holding, D Transfusion, E Operations, F APD Interrogation.</li>
<li id="guide-step-clocks-3" data-guide-step>Read the sixth, unassigned clock and enter its observed four-digit time into Rushmore. The helper cannot derive that final time from the other five.</li></ol><InlineTool tool="bo4-alpha-clocks" />
<InlineTool tool="bo4-alpha-rushmore" /></section>
<section><h2 id="details-tasks">Escort, cores and codes</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-tasks-1" data-guide-step>Complete Rushmore’s Nova escort and ADAM/115-canister tasks. Return items and wait for confirmation before starting the next instruction.</li>
<li id="guide-step-tasks-2" data-guide-step>Collect and install the power cores. Use Brain Rot for the picture/code sequence and record codes with their associated purpose.</li>
<li id="guide-step-tasks-3" data-guide-step>Set the six bunker switches as directed: Diner, Beds and Generators up; Solitary, Storage and Lounge down.</li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-finale">Mannequin, orb and Avogadro</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-finale-1" data-guide-step>Complete the mannequin assembly and orb escort, then prepare for the bunker encounter. Maintain access between rooms and refresh armor/ammunition.</li>
<li id="guide-step-finale-2" data-guide-step>Survive the soul-charge stages and lure the Avogadro through the final containment sequence. Complete Rushmore’s final interaction.</li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-extras">Useful extras: Mark II variants</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-extras-1" data-guide-step>The four Ray Gun Mark II variants have separate frame, ammunition and charge tasks. Choose a variant based on your loadout before spending resources.</li>
<li id="guide-step-extras-2" data-guide-step>Optional Rushmore bonus codes have their own use limits. Do not treat a failed bonus redemption as a failed main-quest code.</li></ol></section><section><h2 id="guide-sources">Sources and review</h2><p>Original concise walkthrough adapted from the sources below. Research reviewed 2026-09-30. Use their illustrated references for exact object sightlines. Gameplay verification is ongoing.</p><ul><li><a href="https://www.reddit.com/r/CODZombies/wiki/alpha-omega/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">r/CODZombies community guide ↗</a></li></ul></section></div></template>
